      "id": "claim_7456deca1b5f4989a9b26990cccce3d2",
      "statement": "Every test command is wrapped in the shared watchdog (idle 60s / total 600s) which kills the whole process tree and exits 124; command arrays are cached as one entry per command so codegen ahead of tests can replay while tests re-run, and the thresholds are baked into the command string because a cached vp run strips undeclared env vars.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/vitest-task-vite-config.ts#L76-L108",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e39b5c6fc16f981a8c4ee41a57b3bc8f1a6a12da3f51787c453395ede7fa88ba:"
        }
